# A relative marker that only comes before its noun.  "deste" is "Contracção
# da preposição de com o pronome este" (Priberam s.v. "deste"): the
# preposition and the demonstrative open the noun that follows, as in "o dia
# 5 deste mês".  So "deste" and "desta" never trail a noun as a postposed
# marker does ("a semana passada"), and no date ends on them.
deste
desta
